\tag{fdip}
\title{Summing the matter coefficient over connections}
\date{2026-11-17}

\p{A finite group gives finitely many assignments to the labeled
links. Each assignment has its own paired matter coefficient.
Their weighted sum is algebraic; division and probability
require further hypotheses on its scalars.}

